# An owner that can't read its files is said at once as the workspace opens, as before #303,
# and the boards' line that it takes the place of is said again after it, for its time (the
# owner's decision of 2026-11-20: shown once for 3 s). tests/drive.rs installs csv-table
# patched to refuse every file it is asked to read, and writes Ashfall.canvas and
# Lahar.canvas, each with a card left out. The boards' line shows as the workspace opens,
# before csv-table has answered.
size 160x44
env COLD_LAVA_EDITOR=none
wait-for example-workspace 35 notes
wait-for csv-table couldn't read Volcanoes/
expect-not boards have cards left out
wait-gone csv-table couldn't read
wait-for 2 boards have cards left out
# `expect` reads the screen once the program pauses, and with an extension running the menu
# draws every 50 ms, so it reads up to a second after the wait: one second of waiting leaves
# the line's 3 s room on a slow machine (#338).
wait 1000ms
expect 2 boards have cards left out (cold-lava items shows each): Ashfall, Lahar
wait-gone 2 boards have cards left out
wait 1000ms
expect-not left out
expect-not couldn't read
keys q
exits 0
